MDA
PHT Y
TIT 'TFStudio protected silver mirror'
MIC
  MWL 400 450 500 550 600 650 700 750 &
      800 850 900 950 1000
  'SiO2' 1.470116 1.465566 1.462326 1.459911 1.458038 1.456535 1.455292 1.454237 &
         1.453317 1.452498 1.451754 1.451065 1.450417
  'Ag' 0.05 0.04 0.05 0.059949 0.055238 0.052575 0.040944 0.030247 &
       0.037529 0.04 0.04 0.04 0.04
  EXT 'Ag' 2.103964 2.648112 3.130684 3.59818 4.010526 4.409558 4.802551 5.195858 &
           5.567119 5.964165 6.373863 6.741926 7.113226
  'Cr' 2.015033 2.322176 2.782654 3.182147 3.201238 3.103746 3.050498 3.074845 &
       3.159071 3.243574 3.310132 3.367711 3.434528
  EXT 'Cr' 2.846766 3.135023 3.306574 3.329919 3.3 3.329583 3.386676 3.416057 &
           3.461735 3.497815 3.524656 3.556707 3.57229
  'BK7' 1.530849 1.52532 1.521414 1.518522 1.516295 1.51452 1.513064 1.511836 &
        1.510776 1.50984 1.508997 1.508223 1.507502
END
INC 1
